<title>FRANCE: Node says delivered all MATIF May sugar lots.</title>
<headline>Node says delivered all MATIF May sugar lots.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MATIF floor-member Node Langlois said on Wednesday it delivered all outstanding 117 lots on the now expired May sugar contract.</p>
<p>The sugar was priced at $306.50 per tonne for delivery to Immingham, one Node Langlois trader said.</p>
<p>Credit Agricole bought 52 lots, Viard Terme five lots and Node Langlois 60 lots, he said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 42215432</p>
